   "text": "Robert Gordon University - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nRobert Gordon University - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nRobert Gordan University is located in Aberdeen and is ranked first in Scotland for Health Professions; Journalism; Architecture; and Pharmacy, while The Sunday Times awarded RGU the title of Best Modern University in the UK for 2012 in its University Guide 2012.\nThe International College offers alternative entry points into Robert Gordon University, both at undergraduate and postgraduate level.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:18\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:45\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £13,923.00\nMin: £12,243.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n8%\n1,245 of 16,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nAberdeen\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ip8omuIBOhc\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
